{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q36", "domain": "health", "question": "请问命主在一岁前被诊断出那一种疾病？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字分析，日主乙木生于丑月极弱，地支四土混杂，天干丙辛合水、乙庚合金，全局寒湿土旺，木火衰绝。年柱丙戌透出丙火伤官，但被月干辛金合化，戌为火库又受丑刑辰冲，火根严重受损，丙火代表心脏、血液系统，先天即带有心火不足、心脏结构脆弱之象。一岁前行运仍在月柱辛丑，流年丁亥，丁火透出却坐亥水受克，水火相战，引发先天隐患，致使心脏问题被早期诊断。综合五行力量与病理取象，符合先天性心脏有孔的特征。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_20070131_P008-Q36", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-final-2023\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_0_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 46857, "response_id": "232eb6ee-7e7d-4814-9aa3-5d799d67466e", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 217, "completion_tokens": 2125, "total_tokens": 2342, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1964}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 217}}
{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q37", "domain": "wealth", "question": "此命主的出身贫或富？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "### 推理分析\n\n1. **八字排盘与日主强弱**  \n   命主乙木，生于丑月（腊月），天寒地冻，土旺木囚。日主乙木在地支无强根（仅辰中藏乙木余气），天干不见印比生扶，反被月干辛金七杀、时干庚金正官贴身克制，官杀混杂攻身，属于身弱格局，亟需印星化杀生身或火暖局。\n\n2. **调候与关键合化**  \n   年干透出丙火伤官，有暖局解冻之功，减轻了寒木之困。丙火与月干辛金相合（丙辛合），生于丑月水旺当令，合化水成功的可能性较高。若合化为水，水为印星，化官杀而生身，变忌为喜，使命主得救应。\n\n3. **出身家庭判断**  \n   年柱代表祖上、童年家庭。年柱丙戌，戌为火库、财库，但丙火伤官被合化为印，减少了伤官泄身之弊，增加了印的助力。月柱辛丑为父母宫，财旺生官杀，但得印星转化，显示父母虽有压力但能给予扶持。原局财星旺而身弱，本主难享祖业、出身寒微，但丙辛化印起到了通关平衡作用，使家庭状况得以提升。综合来看，祖上非大富大贵，但也不至贫穷无依，属于有基本保障、温饱无虞的小康家庭，且能得到父母关爱。\n\n4. **排除其他选项**  \n   命局虽有官杀混杂，但印星转化有情，无孤儿之象（D项无依据）。身弱财旺非富贵家（C项过高）。丙火调候且有印星救应，不至于一贫如洗（A项偏失）。因此，最符合的是小康之家。\n\n### 最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_20070131_P008-Q37", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-final-2023\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_0_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 25810, "response_id": "cda7ec2b-b76e-4f2a-ac83-a671e6209323", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 217, "completion_tokens": 1181, "total_tokens": 1398, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 746}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 217}}
{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q38", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主的身材外貌如何？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "命主日主乙木生于丑月，地支丑丑辰戌四土，土旺金相，天干透辛庚官杀，乙木无强根（仅辰中微根，丑辰湿土难作根），身弱至极，或从弱格。土重则主敦厚，木弱难言高大，故身材不高。土厚多主肌肉，微胖圆脸可能；丙火透出暖局，皮肤不蜡黄，可红润或白净；伤官透干，有一定秀气，但土重官杀压制，整体气质偏向和善而非威严。综合判断，此人宜为偏矮微胖，圆脸和善之貌。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.5, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_20070131_P008-Q38", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-final-2023\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_0_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 31256, "response_id": "6add6238-4e7d-4ab6-8ae3-3d8324540fb3", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 252, "completion_tokens": 1315, "total_tokens": 1567, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1160}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 252}}
